    {
     "page": 3,
     "text": "Objectives\nIdentify real-world applications of AI in everyday life.\nExplain the origins and core concepts of AI.\nRecognize major schools of thought and key technology categories in AI.\nOutline the three major waves of AI development and analyze the causes behind the two \ndownturns.\nEvaluate what AI can and cannot do.\nAnalyze AI-related ethical and security issues, including survivorship bias, moral dilemmas, \nethical conflicts, and response strategies."
    }
