   "objectivePages": [
    {
     "page": 3,
     "text": "Objectives\nBe able to illustrate the concepts and application technology architecture of AI systems.\nBe able to list the three core elements of an AI system and explain how they relate to each other.\nBe able to list the components of a computer system and analyze its fundamental principles.\nBe able to list the computing infrastructure resources of AI systems.\nBe able to identify the structure and modality of AI data.\nBe able to analyze how different types of data are represented in AI systems.\nBe able to list a range of AI algorithms and identify algorithms for typical AI applications."
    }
   ],
