   "objectivePages": [
    {
     "page": 3,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to know:\nBasic concepts of AI\nAI and its history\nAI trends\nSecurity and ethical issues of foundation models"
    },
    {
     "page": 71,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to:\nUnderstand the basic concepts of AI.\nMaster common neural network types.\nFamiliar with common architectures of large models, such as Transformer and \nDiffusion.\nFamiliar with computing power concepts and AI chips."
    },
    {
     "page": 168,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n⚫\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to:\nUnderstand the overall data development process of the AI business.\nUnderstand the overall process of foundation model training.\nUnderstand how to efficiently use large models."
    },
    {
     "page": 247,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n⚫\nOn completion of this course, you will be able to:\nUnderstand the computing requirements of large models.\nUnderstand the network requirements of large models and network products.\nUnderstand the storage requirements of large models and storage products.\nUnderstand the concept of green data centers."
    },
    {
     "page": 290,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n⚫\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to:\n\nUnderstand the large model deployment process.\n\nUnderstand common deployment and optimization methods for large models.\n\nUnderstand common deployment tools for large models.\n\nUnderstand the large model business model."
    },
    {
     "page": 326,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n⚫\nUpon completing this course, you will be able to:\nUnderstand the applications of mainstream open-source large models in the industry.\nUnderstand the applications of mainstream closed-source large models in the industry.\nLearn the background of RAG development.\nUnderstand the working principles and key technologies of RAG.\nUnderstand the basic concepts of AI agents.\nUnderstand key AI agent technologies."
    }
   ],
