   "objectivePages": [
    {
     "page": 3,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n\nUpon completion of this course, you will have learned:\nBasic concepts about artificial neural networks and deep feedforward networks\nHow to train neural network models\nSome methods of gradient descent and the concept of backpropagation\nImportant elements of neural network design"
    },
    {
     "page": 66,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\nOn completion of this course, you will be able to:\nDescribe the computer vision technology.\nGain proficiency in digital image processing fundamentals and image preprocessing \ntechnology.\nUnderstand essential image processing tasks.\nDistinguish between traditional feature extraction algorithms and deep learning \nconvolutional neural networks.\nDevelop knowledge about image recognition and generation theories."
    },
    {
     "page": 250,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n\nOn completion of this course, you will be able to:\nUnderstand the basic concepts and applications of speech processing.\nMaster the basic steps of speech processing.\nMaster the main techniques of speech processing.\nUnderstand the challenges of speech processing."
    },
    {
     "page": 383,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n\nOn completion of this course, you will be able to:\nUnderstand the Definition of NLP.\nUnderstand the application scenarios of NLP.\nUnderstand the core technologies of NLP."
    },
    {
     "page": 499,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will have a basic understanding of:\nAI technology development and trends"
    },
    {
     "page": 522,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\n\nUpon completion of this course, you will:\nUnderstand the product positioning and core technologies of ModelArts.\nAchieve proficiency in core modules of ModelArts, including data processing, algorithm \ndevelopment, model training, model management, model deployment, and AI Gallery.\nLearn about success stories of ModelArts."
    },
    {
     "page": 558,
     "text": "3\nCopyright © Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. All rights reserved. \nObjectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to:\nDescribe the principle of the attention mechanism.\nDescribe the structure of the Sequence-to-Sequence (Seq2Seq) model.\nDescribe the Transformer workflow.\nDescribe the position coding mechanism in Transformer.\nDescribe the encoder-decoder architecture in Transformer.\nDescribe the self-attention mechanism in Transformer."
    }
   ],
