   "objectivePages": [
    {
     "page": 3,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will understand:\na IT architecture development trends and why enterprises need to go cloud\na Basic principles of cloud-based architecture design\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 48,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will:\na Understand common compute services on Huawei Cloud.\na Understand how to select compute resources based on service scenarios and\nhow compute services work with each other.\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 107,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to:\na Understand Huawei Cloud network services well enough to design a secure and\nreliable network architecture based on service scenarios and that minimizes\ncosts.\na Understand the principles and application scenarios of network services, and\nuse network services together with other services.\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 173,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will:\na Acquire a basic understanding of cloud storage.\na Acquire the principles behind and uses of common storage services on Huawei\nCloud.\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 234,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will:\na Understand common database services on Huawei Cloud.\na Understand database service types, their application scenarios, and their related\nservices.\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 305,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will be able to:\na Understand the importance of cloud security and learn basic concepts.\na Get to know the Huawei Cloud security service system and be able to select\nrequired security services based on corporate security requirements.\na Learn how to use cloud security services, design the security architecture, and\nselect required products.\nHUAWEI\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 371,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will understand:\na Open source technologies\na Huawei Cloud Container Engine (CCE) and Cloud Container Instance (CCI)\na Huawei serverless solution (FunctionGraph)\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 435,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will understand:\na Microservice evolution\na Mainstream open-source architectures\na Cloud native services from Huawei Cloud\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 501,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will:\na Understand Huawei Cloud O&M.\na Understand open source O&M tools.\na Understand the features and functions of Huawei Cloud O&M services.\na Be familiar with the Huawei Cloud O&M solution.\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    },
    {
     "page": 563,
     "text": "Objectives\nUpon completion of this course, you will:\na Have a working knowledge of Huawei Cloud's innovative products and solutions\nin mainstream application scenarios, such as El and IoT, and be able to identify\nthe solutions that best suit your needs.\nHUAWEI\n2\nHuawei Confidential\n\n[Native PDF text / speaker notes]"
    }
   ],
